Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:07.34,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:13.04,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:18.74,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:25.14,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:30.96,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.70,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:12.02,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.46,0:01:43.00,Default,,150,0,120,,POLICE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:44.80,Default,,0,0,220,,Laughing Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:52.73,Default,,0,280,70,,Laughing\N Man\NCase \N Special \N Investigation \N HQ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:04.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This one too...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:06.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:11.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yamaguchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.02,0:02:14.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief... Nibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:18.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you doing here so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:20.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What a rude fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:24.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was working.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:26.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Were you still working too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:28.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:37.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about we go for a drink?\NWhy don't you join me once in a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:39.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Um, wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:53.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm done for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:20.00,Default,,120,0,120,,THE \N VISUAL\NDEVICE\NLAUGHS
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:27.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:31.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, this is Yamaguchi;\N I worked with you at the central office.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:33.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yamaguchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:35.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, how have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.88,0:03:36.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's been quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:39.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry to suddenly call so late,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:43.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but there's something I want to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:44.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can we meet now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:46.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:51.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.28,0:03:55.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you remember the Laughing Man case?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:56.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Laughing Man...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:03:58.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:02.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the one where someone kidnapped the presidents of micro-machine manufacturers and asked for ransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:04.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Corporate terrorism" so to speak, that happened six years ago right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:07.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm on the special investigation team for that case now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.48,0:04:10.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But there has been some suspicious activity within.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:13.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The police are fighting over their jurisdiction?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:15.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, it's going on at a higher level.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please, I want to meet with you and talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll be there in about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:22.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay, I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.65,0:04:23.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:47.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So there was an interceptor in my eye too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What, did Togusa stay up all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:14.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:16.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He said he had been waiting for someone since last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:19.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's in that box?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:23.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This? It's Batou's work-out equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:24.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He bought another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:29.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't know what part of himself a cyborg like him trains with those.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:30.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You've got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:32.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Doesn't he have something else to spend his money on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.34,0:05:35.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, you woke up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:38.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,On the capitol highway at night...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:40.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Police officer burnt black?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.47,0:05:43.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you absolutely certain...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.47,0:05:48.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that the call you received was from the officer who died in that accident last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.07,0:05:50.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.07,0:05:53.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He wanted to talk with me about some suspicious activity in the uppers levels of the central office.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you think his death is related to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:06:00.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have no proof, but the timing is just too perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:02.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What were the results of the investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:05.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An unexpected accident caused by sight interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:10.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So it's possible that it was just an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:11.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let him finish his story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:15.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if it was just an accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:21.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If your former colleague did get a hold of something, we need to confirm that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.87,0:06:24.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll give you three days, find something by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.17,0:06:26.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:37.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Laughing Man case, eh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:38.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:41.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I had forgotten about that until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.14,0:06:45.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see that the Special Investigation HQ hasn't been broken up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:48.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you consider the number of companies that received a threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:51.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it's the biggest case of corporate terrorism that has happened since the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:56.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The central office can't easily back out of the case because of public opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:06:59.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But they seem to be taking their time on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:04.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that in the upper levels they still have split views on who the culprit is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:07.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,One theory says that\Nradicals who oppose foreign
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:10.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,corporations that advance\Ncyberbrain and cyborg technology
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:14.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A conspiracy that has arisen from the races between corporations...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:18.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Blackmail solely for money, or many other theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:17.00,Default,,0,160,130,,Lau
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:19.00,Default,,0,190,130,,Laughing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:24.00,Default,,0,190,130,,Laughing Man
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:24.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They don't even have any idea of the culprit's nationality, sex, age,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:29.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,or even if it's done by one person or multiple people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:32.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But there's one theory that many agree on;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.82,0:07:36.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that the culprit is a special class-A hacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:40.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Only the first few cases were the work of a special A-class hacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:42.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I believe the rest were pretty ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:48.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I just don't like that case, the culprit's profile included.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:54.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But if the central office's high officials are trying to pull something,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:56.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,don't you think that we should do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.23,0:08:14.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mr. Togusa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:18.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:20.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm Yamaguchi's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:23.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:30.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But how do you know about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.77,0:08:33.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I heard about you from my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.27,0:08:39.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Actually, I want to give this to you, Mr. Togusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:42.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It came from my husband this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.47,0:08:44.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There was a letter inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:47.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and it told me to give this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:48.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:51.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:58.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you sure that these are it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:08:59.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:02.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:05.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:07.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:09.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:11.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:15.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,22 to 56.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:20.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:23.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.03,0:09:26.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,35 to 28.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:30.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:34.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:43.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.07,0:09:47.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What did Yamaguchi want me to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:52.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mine does something like that sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:56.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh yeah, I need to call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:03.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:05.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't think I'll be able to come home today either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:06.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:09.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:10.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just be sure that you lock up and be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:12.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:14.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:19.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now then, I guess I'll wash my face and look at them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:44.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is two days going to be enough time for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.69,0:11:00.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:16.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,C97, 35 to 28.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:21.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not there...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:23.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get C98.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:26.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:28.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get C96.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.77,0:11:30.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:31.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,C92.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:34.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,4 to 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,42 to 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:45.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:51.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:57.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's no camera in any of these pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:05.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.74,0:12:10.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What does an elite member of Public Safety Section 9 want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:13.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You didn't come to Yamaguchi's funeral, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:15.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought I would see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:18.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was busy with my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:20.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you see his wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:21.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:22.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:25.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He left such a beautiful young wife behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:28.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that the Special Investigation section is having lots of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.30,0:12:31.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, you're talking about the Laughing Man case?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:33.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Everyone's working on it without sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:35.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you have any leads on the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:37.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is starting to sound like an interrogation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:41.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you're not allowed to talk about it, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:43.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:46.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that you'd be able to look up info on it even if I kept quiet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.90,0:12:52.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We found a primary suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:55.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Weren't there a hundred of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:57.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This one's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:58.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:13:00.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He has a grudge against Serrano too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:04.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Serrano Genomics.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:09.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The micro-machine maker that was targeted in the first Laughing Man case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you close to arresting that suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:15.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, the brass is being indecisive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:18.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But this time we have the circumstantial evidence we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:21.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All we need to do now is to get a hold of a clincher.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:22.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:26.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Using an interceptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:28.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An interceptor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:31.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that the visual device\Nthat was introduced after the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:34.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,visual interception law was\Nrevised three months ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:36.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:40.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we can set one up in the suspect, we can get something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:43.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since we won't need to tail him for three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:48.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If he goes to a medical facility, we can have one set up in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:52.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If it works, he won't have any privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:55.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We can even check out the parabola that his piss makes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:57.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:14:00.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The parabola his piss makes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:02.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see, an interceptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:16.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, I found out that all the pictures that Yamaguchi had
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:21.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Were taken from the point of view of the Special Investigation team on the Laughing Man case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:27.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So that was the high officials suspicious activity?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.39,0:14:27.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:31.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But interceptors themselves aren't illegal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:36.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and if you submit the proper documents any police-related personnel are allowed to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.09,0:14:40.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But I could not confirm that any documents were submitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:44.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The presence of a third party, which is required under the law, was not confirmed either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.09,0:14:48.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,According to Fukami,\Nthe Special Investigation team was
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:51.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,looking for a chance to set up\Nan interceptor in the suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:53.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But judging from the prefectural police's records,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:56.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I believe the interceptors were set up inside the eyes of the Special Investigation team
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.82,0:14:59.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,during the health examination at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:04.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That seems a bit too much to observe their work attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:10.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Aren't the interceptors supplied by Serrano Genomics?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:15.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The police have officially used the incident victim's product.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:17.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell something fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:24.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And Fukami, who is keeping an eye on Serrano's president, has an interceptor in his eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:27.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Serrano people and other officers do not know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.02,0:15:30.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that they don't get along well when they're "friends".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:32.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So the pieces are starting to come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:34.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.02,0:15:37.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Doesn't that mean that what Togusa did was all seen by someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:44.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, I would like to take immediate action, but we don't have enough evidence to do this head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:47.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shall I shake them up a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:13.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, but we're not open yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:18.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:20.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:24.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, it's you. Don't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:28.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're still cowardly. Your cyborg body must be crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:31.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you come here just to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:32.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:36.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I want to give this scoop to one of the reporters that visit your bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:42.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You can probably guess that I don't want this going to any government affiliated media...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.34,0:16:47.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Unfortunately I don't get that kind of customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:49.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:52.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then I'll report that this is a tip-off from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:56.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and that this place is a server for information terrorism to the cyber police.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:17:00.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that you still like to tell jokes that wake me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm happy that you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:05.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll give you the money in cash as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.24,0:17:07.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:12.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.04,0:17:14.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're going home?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:16.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why don't you have a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:19.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you have any alcohol that isn't watered down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:21.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:28.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mr. Nibu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.87,0:17:31.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is it true that the interceptor that was introduced after the law was revised
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.67,0:17:35.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,is being used unlawfully within the police department?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:38.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.77,0:17:44.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm talking about the rumour that the Special Investigation team members have interceptors in their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:46.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who said that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:48.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just answer my question please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.87,0:17:51.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.57,0:17:52.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going to have you arrested if you keep this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:53.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mr. Nibu, my camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.87,0:17:54.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:57.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're not driving your car to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:58.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.18,0:18:08.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief Nibu ran away after taking the reporter's camera
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:08.90,Default,,50,0,190,,Suspicion that \N the visual device \N is being used \Nillegally...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:17:59.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mr. Nibu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:13.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that stubborn Aramaki is behind all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:16.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have already taken measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:19.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:23.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, we can get out of this by paying the equivalent of a captain's retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:26.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.32,0:18:31.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My wife has said that she isn't satisfied with the real estate in Holland.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:34.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.62,0:18:37.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will hold the press conference here tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:44.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The incident that was brought up in certain newspapers
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.03,0:18:50.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,about the unlawful use of visual devices in the Niihama Prefecture Police Department's Special Investigation team...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:53.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The superintendent general himself is going to have a press conference?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.53,0:18:56.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This caused more reaction than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:19:01.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He was the chief of the prefectural police when the Laughing Man case occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:06.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like there's something going on inside the police network that they want to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:09.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will now begin the press conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:14.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Due to suspicion that interceptors were being used unlawfully,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:17.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,in violation of the visual interception law,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:21.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,which was raised the other day in weekly magazines and such,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.63,0:19:24.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,we conducted an internal investigation, and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.63,0:19:31.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,District Chief Nibu Kunihiko has given a statement that he was responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:37.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We believe that the chief officer was stuck on the Laughing Man case,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:43.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so he implanted interceptors into each investigator's cyberbrain to gather information.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:47.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He admitted that he temporarily lost his ability to make the right choice because of the stress...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:50.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and he is deeply sorry for committing such an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:57.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But we must admit that the chief officer's actions deviated from his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:20:02.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As of today, the chief officer will be given a disciplinary dismissal,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:09.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and we apologise deeply to the investigators who were working on this case, and their families.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.60,0:20:13.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about the responsibility of the more senior officials?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:17.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I believe there will be an announcement from the General.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:21.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's a rumour that the senior officials and Serrano are working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.60,0:20:25.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We understand that the selection of the product was done within the limits of the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:30.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and I have heard that our adoption of the product was done through official bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:33.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You didn't answer my question!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.20,0:20:37.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Aren't you all the ones who requested the revision in the visual interception law?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:41.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Superintendent general, it seems that you are going to move to Holland after you retire,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:44.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,isn't that where Serrano's parent company is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.60,0:20:46.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is there any relation there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:51.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have no obligation to answer such a personal question!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.30,0:20:53.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you mean you have no obligation?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.10,0:20:54.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.79,0:20:58.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, isn't the camera moving weirdly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:08.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You haven't changed, Superintendent-general Daidoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:13.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nice to meet you. You know who I am, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:18.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:20.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:27.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's wrong, Takegawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:36.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mr. Daidoh, I was thinking that I shouldn't get involved in your world anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:41.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When I deal with that garbage dump of a world, it really makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.98,0:21:46.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's why I didn't say anything during your foolish acts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:48.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I knew everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.19,0:21:53.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In other words, I grew tired of this uselessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.99,0:21:55.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.47,0:22:01.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, you were watching right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.17,0:22:02.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That chief officer's cyber brain...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.97,0:22:07.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But today's act was just horrible. Too horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.67,0:22:11.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was foolish, but it wasn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.17,0:22:16.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's why I, unwillingly, have to challenge you all again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.47,0:22:22.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Three days from now, you're going to have a reunion with the graduates of your farce troupe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:25.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please tell the truth there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:29.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you pull a fake act again,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.77,0:22:33.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will have to erase you from this stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.67,0:22:36.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Takegawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.34,0:22:38.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get an ambulance! Get an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.43,0:22:43.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The conference continues, but we will return to the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.03,0:22:45.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mr. Sakurai at the conference hall...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.64,0:22:47.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is it the real guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:50.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, confirm the situation right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.34,0:22:52.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:22.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:27.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:34.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.90,0:23:39.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.53,0:23:42.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flowe, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.35,0:23:50.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.04,0:23:54.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.44,0:23:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.34,0:24:02.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:07.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.31,0:24:10.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:14.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
